  "releaseNotes": "Release notes for Sectra.UrlLaunch.SharedSecret v1.1.0:\n\n            What's New?\n            - Added support for .NET 10.0, replacing the .NET 8.0 target. Applications on .NET 8 are still supported through the .NET Standard 2.1 target.\n\n            Fixed\n            - Constant-time comparison of byte sequences of differing length now works as intended.\n            - AES, AES-GCM and HMAC instances are now disposed, without closing streams owned by the caller.\n\n            For detailed release history, see: https://github.com/sectra-medical/SectraUrlLaunchSdk/blob/main/src/SharedSecret/CHANGELOG.md",
